fixture strike_air_down_diagonal_pogo
doc falling over the spikes, a strike with the stick 30 degrees below level (x=110 y=63) is a side strike, and a strike with a d-pad's down-right (both axes full) the down-strike, which bounces: strikes read 4 equal 90-degree sectors, the diagonal itself going vertical.
room test/spikes
spawn 800 300
frames 40
input
  0..2 x=110 y=63
  3 x=110 y=63 attack
  4..17 x=127 y=127
  18 x=127 y=127 attack
  19..39 x=127 y=127
end
expect
  at 3 action=side1
  at 18 action=down
  mark bounce 19..30 event.pogo=1
  never 0..39 event.hazard=1
end
